---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy | Struc" description="How Struc handles personal information on this website.">
  <div class="container page">
    <Prose>
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p>This website is run by {site.legalName}, company number {site.companyNumber}.</p>
      <p>
        <strong>What this site collects.</strong> Nothing. There are no cookies, no analytics and no
        tracking on this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>If you email us.</strong> We use your name, email address and anything you tell us to
        reply and to discuss working together. We keep correspondence for as long as it is useful for
        that purpose and delete it on request.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>If you book a call.</strong> Bookings are handled by Calendly, which collects the
        details you enter and shares them with us. Calendly's own privacy notice explains how it
        handles your information.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log visitors' IP
        addresses for security purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Your rights.</strong> You can ask for a copy of the information we hold about you, or
        ask us to correct or delete it, by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. If you are unhappy with how we have
        handled your information, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at
        <a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 56px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .page {
      padding-top: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
